From: =?UTF-8?q?=EA=B9=80=EB=B3=91=EA=B3=A4?= <fharenheit@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:01:40 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Reverted: Restore the IME input handling of v0.118.3-ko.33

Revert the IME changes of v0.118.3-ko.34 to ko.36 (9b7ee2c3, eedd7ca6, 2df12e00), since input
stopped working entirely much more often with them. The source tree of TerminalView and the
fork-only files is back to c0f03f70.
